{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped on a deadly island. Hunted by your past. Only one choice: survive. <strong>Perished Truth</strong>\u00a0is an adrenaline-fueled single-player survival horror game, blending classic &quot;Resident Evil&quot; and &quot;Saw&quot; influences with a modern, intense twist.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shinji Ueda's life was shattered after the death of his wife.\u00a0Desperate to save his terminally ill daughter from sharing the same fate as her mother, he turned to the dark web, crossing paths with forces far more dangerous than he ever imagined.\u00a0Now, hunted for sins he thought he left behind, Shinji wakes up trapped on a desolate island with nine other strangers, each hiding dark secrets of their own.\u00a0To survive, he must endure a series of twisted trials... where failure means death.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perished Truth</strong> fuses classic fixed-camera, tank-control survival horror with modernized controls and aiming. Customize your experience to play your way. Explore a forgotten island, scavenge for weapons and supplies, and face off against the infected, and possibly, your fellow captives. Solve environmental puzzles, unlock new paths, and piece together the truth behind your captors... before time runs out and you become one of the infected.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic survival horror tension with modernized controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed camera angles with optional shoulder-camera perspective</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon and resource scavenging</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twisted puzzles with rewarding outcomes</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3521020?t=1750436423","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3521020?t=1750436423","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521020/bac0a92588a15bc1cbf2722427fe391d05603734/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750436423","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521020/bac0a92588a15bc1cbf2722427fe391d05603734/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750436423","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped on a deadly island. Hunted by your past. Only one choice: survive. <strong>Perished Truth</strong>\u00a0is an adrenaline-fueled single-player survival horror game, blending classic &quot;Resident Evil&quot; and &quot;Saw&quot; influences with a modern, intense twist.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shinji Ueda's life was shattered after the death of his wife.\u00a0Desperate to save his terminally ill daughter from sharing the same fate as her mother, he turned to the dark web, crossing paths with forces far more dangerous than he ever imagined.\u00a0Now, hunted for sins he thought he left behind, Shinji wakes up trapped on a desolate island with nine other strangers, each hiding dark secrets of their own.\u00a0To survive, he must endure a series of twisted trials... where failure means death.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perished Truth</strong> fuses classic fixed-camera, tank-control survival horror with modernized controls and aiming. Customize your experience to play your way. Explore a forgotten island, scavenge for weapons and supplies, and face off against the infected, and possibly, your fellow captives. Solve environmental puzzles, unlock new paths, and piece together the truth behind your captors... before time runs out and you become one of the infected.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic survival horror tension with modernized controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed camera angles with optional shoulder-camera perspective</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon and resource scavenging</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twisted puzzles with rewarding outcomes</p></li></ul>","developers":["DeVoid Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521020/285f385ce23e3aa54f26bd784a4f46ba632f7664/header.jpg?t=1750436423","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3521020/1707274135/fd09751d03ba3d2579397a9251dadbe217daacec/1750857839/dash_av1.mpd?t=1747502397","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3521020/1707274135/fd09751d03ba3d2579397a9251dadbe217daacec/1750857839/dash_h264.mpd?t=1747502397","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3521020/1707274135/fd09751d03ba3d2579397a9251dadbe217daacec/1750857839/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1747502397","id":257140928,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140928/movie480.mp4?t=1747502397","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140928/movie_max.mp4?t=1747502397"},"name":"PT_Trailer30s","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257140928/ccfc2b627c